[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/30.tres]夏侯兰[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]基本信息：[/color] 生卒年不可考；籍贯：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "冀州", "cat": "geography"}]冀州[/url][/color]常山真定（今河北正定）；身份：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "曹操", "cat": "people"}]曹操[/url][/color]部将→[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘备", "cat": "people"}]刘备[/url][/color]军正


